{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"db32bb00-a58e-4d1f-be13-e0b31dc39b1f":{"type":"title","settings":{"text_size":"h2","title_alignment":"left","uppercase_title":false}},"17f82f9d-fa64-4575-94e2-b3e7fdb04ed3":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/vitals\/blocks\/reviews-stars\/aeb48102-2a5a-4f39-bdbd-d8d49f4e20b8","settings":{}},"price":{"type":"price","disabled":true,"settings":{"layout":"price_first"}},"de244682-4323-4802-b4ba-b79b08e0c71d":{"type":"emoji_benefits","settings":{"benefits":"<p>💫 Style Meets Comfort<\/p><p>👖 Tailored For Your Waist<\/p><p>✨ Flattering and Lifting<\/p>"}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_dynamic_checkout":true,"skip_cart":true,"uppercase_text":false}},"4e2aaaa7-4619-4b66-9f28-55ac830aa38e":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Size Chart","icon":"ruler","content":"","page":"size-chart"}},"4996b54e-a9af-4d5e-9542-d3f00ac9f8e0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Hassle Free Refunds","icon":"return","content":"<p>If you don't like your Cargo Pants, we'll refund your money right away!<\/p><p>We provide the 30 Days Money-Back Policy, just so our customers are happy!<\/p>","page":""}},"149aabfb-9fd8-4472-a633-6032dbe01ed0":{"type":"reviews","settings":{"display_stars":true,"avatar_alignment":"top","author_1":"Luna Waverly","text_1":"<p>Stylish and functional - perfect for city strolls or impromptu hikes.  Already ordered another one!<\/p>","author_2":"Ava R.","text_2":"<p>They look good, feel good, and have become my favourite, they're a game-changer.<\/p>","author_3":"Reilly O.","text_3":"<p> I'm not a review person, but these pants are too good not to share. It has pockets for days!<\/p>","padding_top":10,"padding_bottom":0}},"f1d4fb06-ef63-452a-83c0-a821b991b436":{"type":"description","settings":{}}},"block_order":["db32bb00-a58e-4d1f-be13-e0b31dc39b1f","17f82f9d-fa64-4575-94e2-b3e7fdb04ed3","price","de244682-4323-4802-b4ba-b79b08e0c71d","buy_buttons","4e2aaaa7-4619-4b66-9f28-55ac830aa38e","4996b54e-a9af-4d5e-9542-d3f00ac9f8e0","149aabfb-9fd8-4472-a633-6032dbe01ed0","f1d4fb06-ef63-452a-83c0-a821b991b436"],"settings":{"enable_sticky_info":true,"media_size":"small","constrain_to_viewport":true,"media_fit":"cover","gallery_layout":"thumbnail_slider","media_position":"left","image_zoom":"none","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":false,"enable_video_looping":false,"trust_badge_position":"top-right","trust_badge_size":"medium","padding_top":16,"padding_bottom":0}},"57c1246a-3910-435a-a092-5f469710eecc":{"type":"image-with-text","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1113_1.gif","height":"large","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","section_color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":36}},"fbd5cf45-5dbf-4ca0-945b-d3dad769798c":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--21323237949761__fbd5cf45-5dbf-4ca0-945b-d3dad769798c-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<p>Wardrobe Essential<\/p>","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--21323237949761__fbd5cf45-5dbf-4ca0-945b-d3dad769798c-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Dress up or down, our cargo pants effortlessly transition from outdoor escapades to city chic. Pair them with a stylish blouse for a casual day out, or throw on a comfortable tee for a laid-back look. The options are <strong>endless, <\/strong>have your fun with it!<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--21323237949761__fbd5cf45-5dbf-4ca0-945b-d3dad769798c-heading-1","template--21323237949761__fbd5cf45-5dbf-4ca0-945b-d3dad769798c-text-1"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","full_width":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":52}},"dd3a09eb-431d-4c7d-b7e7-255924969477":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"template--21323237949761__dd3a09eb-431d-4c7d-b7e7-255924969477-column-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/download_7_1800x1800_d3e84bff-669c-4174-9665-f78a657ab92e.jpg","title":"","text":"<p>\"These pants pants have become a wardrobe staple for me. First of all, the adjustable strap is a game changer and The fit is not only flattering but also incredibly comfortable! I also love the versatility these pants offer; I can dress them up or down, making them suitable for a range of occasions.\"<\/p>","author":"- Aleysha J"}},"template--21323237949761__dd3a09eb-431d-4c7d-b7e7-255924969477-column-3":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/83305199-1698920073.0946.jpg","title":"","text":"<p>\"I've always struggled to find pants that that fit my waist size. So the adjustable strap in the adventure chic cargo pants really appealed to me. I bought 2 pairs at first on their new offer and they literally fit like heaven, this is the exact look I wanted, Baggy and cute! I now ordered all the colors they have :)<\/p>","author":"- Mellina B"}},"template--21323237949761__dd3a09eb-431d-4c7d-b7e7-255924969477-column-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/download_15_1080x_fa57d2e5-94ec-49c1-b07e-75742dce3b85.jpg","title":"","text":"<p>\"I'm never going back to my old H&M cargo pants ever again! I have found my new favorite, these pants literally fit like they have been tailored to me, my boyfriend loves it when I wear this on our picnic dates. Also, their pockets are really spacious and there is no need to carry a big handbag when I wear these pants.\"<\/p>","author":"- Sophia M"}}},"block_order":["template--21323237949761__dd3a09eb-431d-4c7d-b7e7-255924969477-column-1","template--21323237949761__dd3a09eb-431d-4c7d-b7e7-255924969477-column-3","template--21323237949761__dd3a09eb-431d-4c7d-b7e7-255924969477-column-2"],"settings":{"title":"Hear From Our Family","heading_size":"h2","text":"","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"portrait","columns_desktop":3,"column_ali